#: ../../cloud_host.rst:3
msgid "\"Cloud SaaS-Hosted\" Quick Start"
msgstr "\"Cloud SaaS-Hosted\" Hurtig start"

#: ../../cloud_host.rst:6
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduktion"

#: ../../cloud_host.rst:8
msgid ""
"Similar to a Data-Center MSP-Hosted environment, CentreStack has a Cloud "
"version that is readily hosted."
msgstr "Ligesom et Data-Center MSP-Hosted miljø har CentreStack en Cloud version, der allerede er hosted."

#: ../../cloud_host.rst:10
msgid ""
"This works well for managed service providers who have smaller clients "
"here and there. Because of the smaller number of total clients, the Data-"
"Center MSP-Hosted overhead is relatively high. MSPs can use the Cloud "
"version since it is readily deployed and ready to use."
msgstr "Dette fungerer godt for administrerede tjenesteudbydere, der har mindre klienter hist og her. På grund af det mindre antal samlede klienter er overhead for Data-Center MSP-Hosted forholdsvis højt. MSP'er kan bruge Cloud-versionen, da den er hurtigt udrullet og klar til brug."

#: ../../cloud_host.rst:17
msgid "Preparation"
msgstr "Forberedelse"

#: ../../cloud_host.rst:19
msgid ""
"Since you don't need to prepare the CentreStack server installation any "
"more (it is hosted by CentreStack.com), all that you need to do is create"
" hosted tenants. A tenant, based on business requirement,  is mapped to"
msgstr "Da du ikke længere behøver at forberede installationen af CentreStack-serveren (den hostes af CentreStack.com), er alt, hvad du skal gøre, at oprette hostede lejere. En lejer, baseret på forretningskrav, er kortlagt til"

#: ../../cloud_host.rst:22
msgid "a client of yours"
msgstr "en klient af dig"

#: ../../cloud_host.rst:23
msgid "a company"
msgstr "en virksomhed"

#: ../../cloud_host.rst:24
msgid "an organization in a bigger company"
msgstr "en organisation i et større firma"

#: ../../cloud_host.rst:29
msgid "Create Tenant"
msgstr "Opret lejer"

#: ../../cloud_host.rst:31
msgid "You can create tenants directly from the Hosted-CentreStack."
msgstr "Du kan oprette lejere direkte fra Hosted-CentreStack."

#: ../../cloud_host.rst:36
msgid "Please reference Server Agent User Guide for File Server Migration:"
msgstr "Henvis venligst til Server Agent Brugervejledning for filservermigration:"

#: ../../cloud_host.rst:38
msgid ""
"`Server Agent User Guide "
"<http://www.centrestack.com/Library/ServerAgentGuide/index.html>`_"
msgstr "`Server Agent Brugervejledning <http://www.centrestack.com/Library/ServerAgentGuide/index.html>`_"

